<title>UK: Pemex adds 250 billion lire to 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Pemex adds 250 billion lire to 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been increased to 750 billion lire from 500 billion lire, joint lead managers Banca Commerciale Italiana, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell and UBS said. All terms remain unchanged.</p>
<p> BORROWER   PETROLEOS MEXICANOS (PEMEX)</p>
<p> AMT    750 BLN LIRE  COUPON   * 10.125    MATURITY    13.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-DOWN     ISS PRICE  101.25    PAY DATE    13.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.0	 REOFFER    99.85     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	BA2	 LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  BB	  DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/UK/MX/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.60	SELL CONC  1.40	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    * FOR FIRST TWO YEARS, 7.375 THEREAFTER</p>
<p>		GUARANTEED BY PEMEX EXPLORACION Y PRODUCION, PEMEX</p>
<p>		REFINANCION, PEMEX GAS Y PETRO QUIMICA BASICA</p>
<p>		THERE IS AN OPTION TO REDENOMINATE INTO EUROS AT THE</p>
<p>		THIRD STAGE OF EMU</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
